    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just dont have the time or money for an eye doctor right now. work is crazy and insurance is a nightmare. i feel like if i just take some extra melatonin and maybe some magnesium to help me sleep and relax, the eye stuff will just go away once im rested. u think it's possible it's just my nervous system being fried? like can i just try to sleep it off for a few days?",
