      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. i don't have time for a whole medical thing. my cousin had something similar once and she just used these special eye drops and took some high dose vitamin b and it cleared up in a week. if i just take a bunch of vitamins and stay in a dark room for a few days to rest my eyes, do u think that could help settle it down? like is there a specific dose of vitamins or something i should try instead of going in?",
